            "text": "Semgrep Finding: python.lang.security.use-defused-xml.use-defused-xml The Python documentation recommends using `defusedxml` instead of `xml` because the native Python `xml` library is vulnerable to XML External Entity (XXE) attacks. These attacks can leak confidential data and \"XML bombs\" can cause denial of service."
