            "text": "Semgrep Finding: javascript.express.security.audit.express-check-csurf-middleware-usage.express-check-csurf-middleware-usage A CSRF middleware was not detected in your express application. Ensure you are either using one such as `csurf` or `csrf` (see rule references) and/or you are properly doing CSRF validation in your routes with a token or cookies."
